# ---- generated, never committed -------------------------------------------------
# The repo is kept under 100 MB. Everything below is rebuilt by a tool, and what to
# run is in docs/ASSETS.md. docs/shots and public/cities alone were 705 MB of the
# 772 MB that used to be tracked.
#
# NOTE: gitignore has no inline comments — a trailing "# ..." becomes part of the
# pattern and silently matches nothing. Keep every comment on its own line.

# every screenshot: model shots, contact sheets, references
docs/shots/
# baked city packages and their streamed tiles (npm run bake)
public/cities/
# generated GLBs, signgen's included (npm run signs)
public/models/
# generated SF street trees (tools/sftrees/library.py)
public/sftrees/
public/plants/
public/trees/*.glb
scratchpad/
# OSM extracts, Overpass chunks, Mapillary tiles and photos
tools/cache/
# reference photographs gathered for hand modelling
statues_to_model/

